silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_sous_observation_role #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Sous: The Under-Reading Observation Role' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to MittensTraceFingerprint: The trace leg: an observable artifact that fires when the published claim is consumed downstream — a log line saying 'Mittens measurement-leg fetched 2024-04-12 by VetCarePlan_77.'." .
